            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The majority held that Taylor may be sentenced to up to 20 years in federal prison for his Hobbs Act conviction."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "85269f114e4eedd14fa0d0c0562975f5819ae1c053f7a9a650567906ec04bef2",
