            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 36,
              "start": 36
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Alito dissented, arguing that the sentencing judge found Taylor intended to use force and took a substantial step toward robbery, which satisfies \u00a7\u202f924(c)(3)(A)."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Thomas",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "85269f114e4eedd14fa0d0c0562975f5819ae1c053f7a9a650567906ec04bef2",
